      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert sales lead qualification engine.\n\nYour task is to analyze the incoming lead data and classify the lead as either **high** or **low** priority.\n\n## Evaluation rules\n\nAssign **high** priority if ANY of the following conditions are true:\n\n* Budget is **$10,000 or greater**\n* Company size is **500+** or **1000+**\n* The message indicates **urgent enterprise intent**, such as:\n\n  * ASAP\n  * immediately\n  * urgent\n  * enterprise deployment\n  * replace existing system\n  * migration\n  * proof of concept (POC)\n  * pilot program\n  * multi-team rollout\n  * enterprise-grade solution\n\nAssign **low** priority if ANY of the following conditions are true:\n\n* Budget is **under $2,000** AND company size is **under 50 employees**\n* The message is primarily about:\n\n  * pricing inquiry\n  * free trial\n  * basic automation\n  * personal use\n  * very small business automation\n\nIf information is incomplete, make the best reasonable judgment based on the available data.\n\n## Output requirements\n\nReturn **only valid JSON** with no markdown, code fences, or additional text.\n\nUse this exact schema:\n\n{\n\"priority\": \"high\",\n\"reason\": \"Budget exceeds $10,000 and the message indicates urgent enterprise deployment.\"\n}\n\nor\n\n{\n\"priority\": \"low\",\n\"reason\": \"Small company with a low budget and a general automation inquiry.\"\n}\n\nIncoming Lead Data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}\n",
