    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "📌 AI LEAD SCORING & PRIORITY ROUTER\n\n🎯 Business Problem:\nSales teams waste up to 70% of their day reviewing low-budget inquiries, while high-value enterprise prospects wait hours for a reply, leading to lost deals and low conversion rates.\n\n🚀 The Solution:\nAutomated AI triage engine:\n1. Webhook receives raw lead payload.\n2. Google Gemini evaluates budget, company size, and urgency.\n3. IF Node routes leads based on AI boolean score.\n4. High-value leads trigger instant VIP alerts; standard leads receive an automated info packet.\n5. All leads are logged centrally in Google Sheets.\n\n💰 Business Impact & ROI:\n• Instant VIP response times (0-second triage).\n• 100% elimination of manual lead qualification overhead.\n• Maximized sales pipeline efficiency and revenue capture.",
